# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Engineering --out` from tools/lib/professions/routes/engineering.json and data/forever. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/engineering
title Engineering 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Engineering builds explosives, gadgets and goggles out of stone, bars and cloth. Mining is its
# partner: almost every recipe uses stone or bars, and without Mining they come from the Auction
# House.
#
# Many parts are made for later recipes: powders, bolts, tubes and casings. Keep everything the
# guide says to keep.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice at any level from any Engineering trainer (the first trainer teaches recipes
# only up to 75); Journeyman from level 10 at the city trainers; Expert from level 20 at Roxxik in
# Orgrimmar or Springspindle Fizzlegear in Ironforge; Artisan from level 35 at Buzzek Bracketswing
# in Gadgetzan, for both factions.
#
# Specialisation (optional, not needed for 300) opens at 200 and level 30: Gnomish or Goblin
# Engineering.
#
# The route (crafts are about what it takes; yellow and green recipes can take a few more):
# Apprentice (1-56), from level 1:
#    1-35  56 Rough Blasting Powder: 56 Rough Stone
#   35-55  28 Handful of Copper Bolts: 28 Copper Bar
#   55-56  1 Arclight Spanner: 6 Copper Bar
# Journeyman (56-150), from level 10:
#   56-75  28 Rough Copper Bomb: 28 Linen Cloth, 28 Copper Bar, 56 Rough Blasting Powder, 28 Handful of Copper Bolts
#   75-90  51 Coarse Blasting Powder: 51 Coarse Stone
#   90-100 17 Coarse Dynamite: 17 Linen Cloth, 51 Coarse Blasting Powder
#  100-105 5 Silver Contact: 5 Silver Bar
#  105-125 25 Bronze Tube: 50 Bronze Bar, 25 Weak Flux
#  125-135 10 Standard Scope: 10 Moss Agate, 10 Bronze Tube
#  make 40 Heavy Blasting Powder: 40 Heavy Stone
#  135-150 15 Whirring Bronze Gizmo: 15 Wool Cloth, 30 Bronze Bar
# Expert (150-200), from level 20:
#  150-160 15 Bronze Framework: 15 Medium Leather, 15 Wool Cloth, 30 Bronze Bar
#  160-175 15 Explosive Sheep: 30 Wool Cloth, 15 Whirring Bronze Gizmo, 30 Heavy Blasting Powder, 15 Bronze Framework
#  175-193 61 Solid Blasting Powder: 122 Solid Stone
#  193-194 1 Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor: 4 Steel Bar
#  194-195 3 Iron Grenade: 3 Iron Bar, 3 Silk Cloth, 3 Heavy Blasting Powder
#  195-200 6 Mithril Tube: 18 Mithril Bar
# Artisan (200-300), from level 35:
#  200-215 21 Unstable Trigger: 21 Mithril Bar, 21 Mageweave Cloth, 21 Solid Blasting Powder
#  215-238 40 Mithril Casing: 120 Mithril Bar
#  238-250 20 Hi-Explosive Bomb: 40 Solid Blasting Powder, 20 Unstable Trigger, 40 Mithril Casing
#  250-260 44 Dense Blasting Powder: 88 Dense Stone
#  260-286 28 Thorium Widget: 84 Thorium Bar, 28 Runecloth
#   with Schematic: Thorium Shells:
#    286-300 14 Thorium Shells: 28 Thorium Bar, 14 Dense Blasting Powder
#   Thorium Tube (no plans):
#    286-300 15 Thorium Tube: 90 Thorium Bar

